stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NormalMode
    NormalMode --> StaffMode: Btn 0+1 hold 2s
    NormalMode --> DeviceInfo: Btn 0+1+5 hold 3s
    NormalMode --> Reboot: All 6 hold 10s
    StaffMode --> NormalMode: Timeout 10s
    StaffMode --> NFCScan: Button 0-5 pressed
    DeviceInfo --> NormalMode: Any button or timeout
    Reboot --> [*]: LED solid 3s then reboot
    NFCScan --> NormalMode: Timeout or Fail
    NFCScan --> ProcessAction: Card Read Success
    ProcessAction --> NormalMode: Done

    note right of NormalMode
      Buttons 0 to 5 tapped: vote
      LED on 1 second
      Uplink event sent
      5 second lockout
      LED off
    end note

    note right of StaffMode
      Timeout: 10 seconds
      LED solid
    end note

    note right of DeviceInfo
      Show end device info on EPD
    end note

    note right of NFCScan
      Timeout: 5 seconds
      LED blink 1Hz
    end note

    note right of ProcessAction
      Button 0: Check-in
      Button 1: Check-out
      Buttons 2-5: Registered vote
    end note
